How to read the three nulls together:
  Null 1 (__neighbors rows) significant AND Null 2 significant AND
  Null 3 significant  →  strong evidence the RWR-selected neighbors carry
  real, network-topology-dependent functional signal, not just seed bias.
  Null 1 significant but Null 2/3 NOT significant  →  signal is mostly
  attributable to seed-gene identity, not to the network expansion step.
